<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Ṭah Hla</book>
  <para style="h">Ṭah Hla</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṭah Hla</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ṭah Hla</para>
  <para style="mt">Ṭah Hla</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E khai! Khaw lûn tak ni ṭhîn chu A va chul ta teh ruai êm! Hnam tin ngaihsân ni ṭhîn chu Hmeithai ang a ni ta. Khaw ropui tak ni ṭhîn chu Chhiah khua a chang ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zânahte pawh a ṭap tlawk tlawk a, A biangah mittui a luang nguah nguah, Amah ngaina ṭhîntu, thlamuantu rêng a nei lo ve, A ṭhiante chuan an bum, Hmêlma an chang zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judai ram mite chu hrehawm tuarin salah an tâng, Hnam dang zîngah an awm darh a, Hahchawlhna rêng an hmu zo lo. Ûmtute chuan an nangchîng a, an chêp ta hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zion panna kawng chu a ṭhing ṭhuap a, Kût hmang tûr pawh an awm ta lo. Kawngkhârte chu a chhe zo va, A hlui ṭhuap mai a ni. Zai thiam nulate chu an chau zo va, Puithiamte pawh an rûm an rûm mai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmêlmate chu hotu-ah an chang a, An thaw a veng kher mai. An sual êm vângin Lalpan a hrem a ni, Hmêlmate chuan an fanaute salah an kawisak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion ropuina chu a chuai zo ta, An hotute pawh chu sazuk ûm nek Ṭâmchhâwl chau hnêp ang mai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem chuan hrehawm mangan a tuar hnuin, A hmânlai ropuina a hre chhuak a, Hmêlmaten an rawn lâk lai khân, Puitu rêng a nei lo. A chan chhe ta êm chu hmêlmaten an diriam e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem chuan thil sual a ti nasa êm a, A bawlhhlawh ta a ni. Ngaisâng ṭhîntute chuan an hmusit a, A saruak an hmuhsak avângin Zakin a rûm a, lehlam a hawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bawlhhlawhna, a pawnfêna kai chu Thup tumna pawh a nei thei lo. A chhiat dân chu a râpthlâk êm êm a, Thlamuantu rêng an awm lo ve. “En teh, Lalpa , kan chan chhiatzia hi, Hmêlmate an dinchan tâk hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thil ṭha neih hmêlmaten an suam a, Hnam dang kal phal lohna Hmun Thianghlima an lût a thlîr reng mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ei tûr zawngin mite chu an rûm a, Intunnun nân an thil ṭha neihte chuan ei tûr an lei. “ Lalpa , kan nêpzia hi, en teh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Veivâkte hnênah chuan, “En teh u, Ka tuar anga tuar nasa hi awm ve maw, Lalpa thinurna ni a thleng a, ka tuar a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vânsâng aṭangin mei a rawn thlâk a, Min kâng ta a, min titlâwm ta a ni. Ka awh nân thang a kam a, A letlingin min khai, Awm ngaihna hre lovin ka chau nilêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sual a ṭâwn khâwm a, amah ngeiin min awrhtîr a, A nghâwngkawl chu min bahtîr a, a rit êm a, ka chau zo ta. Lalpan hmêlma kutah min hlân ta a ni, Ka tluk lohte kutah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan zînga mi huaite Lalpan a thamlo hle, Min bei tûrin sipai tam tak a ko khâwm a, Kan tlangvâlte tihlum tûr leh Sâwrkhura grep rah sâwr anga, Kan nulate rap sâwr tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvâng alâwm ka ṭah chiama, Ka mittui pawh a luan zung zung, Min thlamuan tûr an darh zo va, Min tiharh tûr an awm hek lo. Hmêlmate chu an chak tâk avângin ka fate chu an hawihai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion chuan bân a phar vêl a, Thlamuantu rêng a hmu zo lo, Jakoba chu Lalpan a vêla mite a huattîr a, Jerusalem chu bawlhhlawh angin an ten a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa zawng a dik a, a thu ka awih lo zâwk a ni, Mi tinrêngin ka thu hi ngaithla teh u, Ka tuar nasatzia en teh mah u, Kan nula leh tlangvâlte chu salah an tân tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Min hmangaih ṭhîntute ka han au va, Min lo bum reng alâwm, Intihharh nân ei tûr an zawng lai chu, Puithiamte leh kan upate tualah an tlu hlum e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa , ka tuar dân hi en teh, Ka sa huai huai a, lung lêm ka nei thei lo. Ka sual vâng a ni e, pawi ka va han ti êm! Khandaih avângin tualah lusûn an pung. In chhûngah hripui a lêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka rûm thâwm hi ngaithla teh u, Thlamuantu rêng ka nei lo ve, Min tuartîr a ni tih ka hmêlmaten An han hriat chuan an lâwm êm êm, I hun tiam chu han thlentîr la, Keimah ang hian tuar ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An thil sual tihte chu hmu ve tawh la, Ka sual vânga min hrem ang hian hrem ve ang che, Hrehawm tuarin ka chauh hnêp hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E khai! Lalpa thinurin Zion khua chu thimin a khuh tâk hi. Israel ropuina chu vân aṭangin leiah a paih thla a, A thinur ni-ah chuan a ke nghahchhan A theihnghilh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan dîm lo tawpin Judai ram khuate chu a tichhia a, A thinur a, an kulhte chu a tichim bawk. An ram leh an hotute a titlâwm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thinur so sâin Israel chakna chu a tichhia a, Hmêlma an lo kalin a pui duh lo, A vêl kâng fai vek ṭhîn meialh angin Jakoba chungah chuan a thinur chu a alh tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmêlma angin a thal chuan a kâp a, An enchim loh fanaute chu a thah zawhsak. Zion khuaa inahte chuan a thinur mei a leih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu hmêlma ang mai a ni, Israel-te a lem zo va, An kulhte leh an in ropuite a tichhia a, Judai ram chhûngah lusûn rûnpui a thlentîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huana bûk ram angin inkhâwmna inte chu a tiram zo ta a, Zion-ah chuan inkhâwmpui te, sabat serh te, An titâwp ta vek a, A thinur avângin lal leh puithiamte chu a hnâwl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A maichâm chu Lalpan a rauhsan a, A Hmun Thianghlim a hawisan ta. A bangte chu hmêlma a ṭhiattîr a, Hlim taka kûtpui an hman ṭhinnaah khân, Hmêlma an haw haw dur dur mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan Zion kulh chu tihchhiat a tum tlat a, A chhe tûr chin a rîn fel a, A kut thlâk chu a na ngei mai, In sângte leh kulh bangte chu a chim rem rum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kawngkhârte thil chhe hnawkin a chhilh zo va, A kalhna thîr tlâwnte a bung rum mai. Lal leh miliante chu salah an tâng, Dân lah an inzirtîr tawh lo, Zâwlneite pawhin Lalpa inlârna rêng an dawng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion khaw upate chu leiah ngawi rengin an ṭhu a, An lu vaivut phulin saiip an sin a, Jerusalem nulate chu leiah an kûn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mittui avângin ka meng phe ruai a ni, Ka mite chan chau chu ka lainat êm êm a, ka lung a chhia a ni. Naupangte leh nausênte chu Tual zau laiah an thidang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rilṭâm leh tuihâlin an nute hmaah an ṭap a, Khawlaiah chuan hliam tuar angin an tlu, An nute malchungah an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, eng nge ka sawi tâk ang? Nang ang hi tu nge awm? Aw Zion nula, engtin nge ka thlamuan tâk ang che? A hliam tuar chu tuifinriat anga zau a ni a, Tu nge tidam thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zâwlneite chuan thil ho leh dâwt an hmuhsak che a, I sim theih nân i sualte an tilang ngai lo, Inlârna an hmuhte chu Thil lawilo leh inbumna mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, i bula kalte chuan Kut bêngin an chek khum che; Lu an thing a, ‘Hei hi maw khaw mawi ber, Khawvêl chhuan chu!’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hmêlmaten an nuihzat che a, An faifûk a, an ha an ṭhial khum che, ‘Kan lem zo ta, kan duhthusâm thlen ni Kan hmuh tâk hi,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpan a thiltum chu a ti ta a, Hmâna a sawi lâwk daih tawh chu a hlen ta a ni; Dîm hlek lovin a tichhia a, Hmêlmate chuan lâwmin in chungah bawp an khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, i bangte chuan Lalpa au se, A chhûn a zân i mittui chu luipui ang luang rawh se, Bâng lêk lovin ṭap ṭap mai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tho la, zankhuain Lalpa au rawh, Lalpa hmaah i thinlung chu tui angin leihbua la, Kawtthlêr tina rilṭâma chau i fate nun nân, Bân phar chungin dîl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa , heti taka i sawisak tâkte hi, en teh, An fa pawmlaite sa an nuten an ei ang maw? Puithiam leh zâwlneite, Lalpa Hmun Thianghlimah an tualthi tûr em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kawtthlêrahte naupang leh tar an thi phung mai, Nula leh tlangvâl rual khandaihin an thi, I sâm buan e, lainat lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khâwmpui urhsûna kal khâwm angin, I thinur ni-ah chuan, Kil tin ata kan hmêlmate i ko khâwm a, Lalpa thinurna ni pumpelha him rêng kan awm lo, Kan fa pawm lai, kan chawi tleite, Hmêlmaten an that zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A thinur tianga vuak tuartu ka ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ênga kal lovin thimah min hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni tin a kut ka tuar reng mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Min tichêr a, ka vuai then mai, Ka ruhte pawh min tihtliahsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rilru na leh hrehawmin min tuam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thi tawhte angin thimah min awmtîr hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khaidiatin min phuar tlat a, Chhuak thei lovin min khung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ṭanpui dîla ka au a hre duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka kalkawngan lung bang a rem tlat a, a tiping zo ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Savawm angin min châng ru a, Sakeibaknei biru ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kawngte chu hlîngin a hnawh khat a, Min chhun pem pheng phung mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thalngul a kuai a, min tin reng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A bâwma thal ka thinhnûnah a bûr,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin mi nuihzat a, Ni tinin hla min sak el ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ning hlui khawpin thil khâ min intîr a, Thil hrehawm tak min tuartîr hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭiau lung min ṭhialtîr a, Vaivutah min tâltîr hrep a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungmuanga awm ka nei lo va, Nuam ka hre tawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tuar ta ngang lo ve, Lalpa lakah ka beisei a bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tuarna leh ka vahvaihna Hriat chhuah hi hrehawm tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka chhui ka chhuiin ka chau hnêp ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi ka hriat chhuahin ka bei a sei leh ṭhîn:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa ngilneihna leh a lainatna chu A chuai ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thar zêl ṭhîn tûk tinin; A va rinawm tak êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa hi ka neih chhun a ni a, Amahah chuan ka innghat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amah nghâka zawngtute tân Lalpa hi zawng a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpan min chhandam hun tûr chu Nghah mai a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naupan lai ngeia chhel zir a ṭha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hrehawm hle mah se, ngawi renga Tuar ngat ngat tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kûna dawh mai tûr a ni a, Beidawn tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Biangah min bêngin min diriam ṭhîn mah se, Dawh mai tûr a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa chuan min hnâwl hlen dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Min tilungngai na a, ngil a nei êm mai a, Min lainat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mihring tihlungngaih leh tihnat hi A duhzâwng a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Saltâng nghaisak chîngte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chungnungbera hmuha hleih neih te leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi chan ai chhuhsak te hi Lalpa huatzâwng tak a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpan thu a pêk loh chuan tu thu nge hlawhtling ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chungnungbera kâ aṭang chuan Thu chhia thu ṭha a chhuak dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng hian kan sual vânga kan tuarin Phunnawi tûr em kan nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kan awm dân hi chhûtin i fiah ang u khai, Lalpa lam i hawi ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Vâna Pathian lamah thinlung hawngin I ṭawngṭai zâwk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Thil sual tiin kan hawisan che a, Nangin min ngaidam lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thinur takin min ûm zâwk a, Dîm hlek lovin min tihhlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chhûm chhah takin i inkhuh a, Kan ṭawngṭaina i hnên a thleng thei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hnam tin zîngah bawlhhlawh vawm khâwma min siam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kan hmêlmaten diriam takin min au khum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk leh hrehawm kan tuar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chhiatpui kan tawh avângin Ka mittui hi a luang zawih zawih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Bâng lovin ka ṭap ka ṭap mai dâwn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Vân aṭangin Lalpan min rawn bih, min hmuh hma chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Khawpuia kan fanute tuar ka hmuh chuan Min tilungchhia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hmêlmate chuan a chhan awm hauh lovin Sava ang ziazângin min veh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A nung chungin khurah min thlâk a, lungin min dêng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuiin ka lu a rawn chîm chuan Ka thi dâwn ta emaw ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Khur mawng aṭangin, Lalpa , ka rawn au che a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ka au thâwm chu I ngaithla a, beng hup lovin ka rûm i lo hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ka han auh tâk che chuan mi rawn hnaih a, ‘Hlau suh,’ mi ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Lalpa , min rawn chhan a, ka nun i humhim ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Lalpa , ka tuarna i hmu ta a, ka chungthu hi han rêl fel rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Phuba lâk tuma an inrâwn khâwm hi, I hmu reng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Lalpa , min diriam dân hi i hre reng a, Min phiar dânte lamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Min beitute chu nilêngin Ka chungchâng thu sawiin an phun sur sur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />En teh, an ṭhut pawhin an din pawhin Hla min sak el.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Lalpa , an thiltih ang zêlin thungrûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Ânchhia lawh la, beidawng rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Thinrimin ûm nek teh, Lalpa , Vân hnuai ata tiboral rawh.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E Khai, rangkachak chu a thîm ta tlul mai a! Rangkachak ṭha chi chu a va danglam ta êm! Hmun Thianghlim sakna lungte chu Kawtthlêr pêng ṭhuamahte an paih darh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion tlangvâlte chu Rangkachak ṭha chi ang an ni ṭhîn a, Bêlvawtu hlumbêl ang lek an nih tâk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chinghnia pawhin a no hnute a pe ṭhîn a, Ka mite erawh chu thlalêr vanghâwngsei Nun râwng tak ang hi an ni ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An pawm laite tuihâl dangchârin an awm a, An faten ei tûr an ngên a, an pe duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil tui tui ei ṭhînte chu tualah an ṭâmchhâwl a, Puan senduk sin ṭhînten bawlhhlawh paih khâwm an hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu ma khawih lohvin Sodom khua a chhe thut a, A mite tuar aiin ka mite tuar a nasa daih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan hotute chu vûr aia vâr, Hnutetui anga pâwl phêt, An taksa chu Rubi anga sâr, Safir lung nawh mâm ang ni ṭhîn kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An hmêlte chu meihawl aiin a dum ta a, Tuala an awm hriat hran rual an ni ta lo, An chêr ṭhiak a, an ro rem a, Thing ro ang mai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ei tûr hmu lo, châk ngawih ngawih si, Rilṭâma thi tate ai chuan khandaiha thahte chan a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka miten chhiatpui an tawh meuh chuan, Nu ngilnei tak takte pawhin An fate hial an chhûm a, an ei ta mai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpan a thinur chu a hrithla ta a ni, Zion-ah chuan a thinur mei a chhuah a, A lungphûm lamin a tichhe zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei lalte leh khawvêla mi zawng zawngten Beitu hmêlma Jerusalem khuaah An luh theih rêng an ring ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlneite sual vâng leh puithiamte khawloh vâng a ni, Khaw chhûngah chuan mi dik thisen an chhuah si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mitdel angin tualah an vâk dun dun a, An kawrahte thisen a kai hnuang a, Tu man an khawih thiang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miten, ‘In bawlhhlawh e, kal daih rawh u, Kal bo daih rawh u, min khawih ang e,’ an ti. Hnam tin zîngah an vâkvai a, ‘Hetah an awm kan phal hlei nêm,’ an lo ti zêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa a thinur a, a tidarh ta a ni, A ngaihsak tawh hauh lo, Puithiam a duhsak chuang lo va, Kan upate a khawngaih bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Min pui thei lo puih beiseiin Mit tla dâwnin kan thlîr. Min chhan thei lo hnam chu Kan nghâk thlâwn mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmêlmate chuan kan hnu an chhui zêl a, Kawtthlêrah pawh kan lêng ngam lo, Kan ral dâwn ta a ni, Kan ni a liam ta a, kan thi mai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vânsâng ata mupui lo bir aiin min ûmtute an chak zâwk a, Tlângahte pawh min ûmzui a, Thlalêrahte min lo tlân khalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa hriakthih, kan belh ber chu, An thangah chuan a âwk ta si. ‘Ama hovin hnam dang kârahte pawh, Kan awm ang chu,’ kan lo ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uz rama chêngte leh Edom mi leh sate u, In theih lai hian hlim ula, lâwm rawh u, In chungah pawh chhiatna no chu a lo thleng dâwn, In rui ang a, saruakin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zion fanaute chuan in tuar tûr chu in tlâk ta a, Salah in tâng tawh lo vang. Nangni Edom mite erawh chuan in tuar dâwn e, In sualzia hi a thai lang dâwn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , kan chunga thil thleng hi hre reng ta che, Min rawn thlîr la, kan mualpho tâkzia hi en teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan rochan ramte chu hnam dangin an nei a, Kan inte pawh ram dang miten an luah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa nei lovin kan fahrah a, Kan nute pawh an hmeithai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan tui ngei chu kan in dâwnin lei a ngai ta a, Kan thing ngei pawh a man kan pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bâwng nghâwngkawl min bahtîr a, min khalh nek a, Kan rim hle a, chawlh pawh kan châwl thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ei tûr kan neih hrâm nân Aigupta leh Asuria kan be tlawn ruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan pate chuan thil sual an ti, an thi tawh a, An sual mawh chu keinin kan phur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawihten kan chungah ro an rêl a, An kut ata min chhan chhuak tûr tu mah rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlalêra suamhmang rualin ram an dâp a, Thih huam hiala ei tûr kan dap a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuk ang maiin kan pangte a sa a, Ṭâm chu a nat êm vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion-ah chuan kan nupuite an pâwngsual a, Judai rama nulate pawh an tlâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan hotute banah an khai a, Upa hmêl lah an zah chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlangvâlte chu buhherkhâwlah an chhawr, Naupangte lah thing têl puin an pai chawn chawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upate chu kulhkawngkaah an ṭhu ta lo, Ṭhalaite chuan ṭingṭang an thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan hlimna kha a reh ta a, Kan lâm ṭhîn kha, lusûn ang kan ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan pârṭhi khim a ṭîl zo ta, Kan sual a ni, kan va khawngaihthlâk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian kan lung a chhia a, Hêng avâng hian khua pawh kan hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zion tlâng chu a ram ta a, Sihal rualte an tualchai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa , nang zawng, kumkhuaa lal i ni, I lalna chuan tâwpintai a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Engtizia nge min theihnghilh tâk reng le? Min kalsan kumkhua dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa , i lamah min hruai la, Min hruai kîrin hmânlai ang khân min tithar leh ta che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nge, min paih thla hlenin Kan chungah hian i thin a ur reng dâwn?
  </para>
</usx>
